                <li><strong>Multiplication:</strong> <code>/multiply/&lt;num1&gt;/&lt;num2&gt;</code> (e.g., <a href="/multiply/10/5">/multiply/10/5</a>)</li>
                <li><strong>Division:</strong> <code>/divide/&lt;num1&gt;/&lt;num2&gt;</code> (e.g., <a href="/divide/10/5">/divide/10/5</a>)</li>
